This is a working _released_ Message Base Optimiser.  Read the #?.doc files.

- All files are Amiga executables

- Optimiser and Installer are a matched pair.

- Message_Reader allows you to read your Message Base from the CLI.

- Message_Verifier will scan your entire message base, informing you of
  any problems.

- Old_Delete allows you to delete any messages older than <days> old, from
  your message base.

To compile/assemble the source, you'll need SAS C 6.X.


